description=Keeps EHT/MLO/6GHz capabilities available, applies a standards-compliant Android Wi-Fi country profile with framework+driver readback, and exports detailed Wi-Fi 7 diagnostics for pudding/peach_v2. Does not patch regdb, bypass DFS/AFC, or force out-of-domain TX power.
